     margin: 2rem;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n        }\n        p{\n            font-size: 1rem;\n        }\n    <\/style>\n\n\n    <h1>COMFORTABLE SANDALS FOR MEN & WOMEN<\/h1>\n    <p>Sandals and flip flops don’t just have to be reserved for warm weather. At Vionic, we believe that sandals are easy shoes to wear with any outfit, no matter where you are going. Easy to slip into when you are in a hurry, you can wear them to the grocery store or even wear them as comfortable walking sandals for your next outdoor adventure. Whether you are shopping for comfortable sandals for women or men, when you step into a pair of sandals, they should be stylish and comfortable to wear. Whether you have flat feet, wide feet, or feet with high arches, you will find a pair of sandals that offer support and all-day comfort with a difference you can feel.<\/p>\n    <div id=\"moreText\">\n        <p>That’s why we created comfortable sandals for men and women. Sandals with arch support make perfect travel shoes that you can wear for long periods of time. Find durable and lightweight comfortable sandals for walking around in or cute sandals with arch support to wear to a destination wedding. We even have beach sandals with arch support, perfect for walking on the sand. Whether you’re looking for men’s casual leather sandals or women’s strappy sandals to dress up for a dinner out, our selection of sandals is exactly what you’re looking for. If you’re looking for shoes for plantar fasciitis or foot pain relief, we create comfortable, stylish shoes with proper arch support for everyday wear. For your new favorite pair of shoes, find comfortable sandals that fit your style from Vionic.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <button id=\"readMoreBtn\" onclick=\"toggleText()\">Read More<\/button>\n\n    <script>\n        function toggleText() {\n            const moreText = document.getElementById(\"moreText\");\n            const btn = document.getElementById(\"readMoreBtn\");\n\n            if (mor